# 💻 Practice Logic 2 — Name and Length

```python
names = ["Manoj", "Python", "Java"]

result = {i: len(i) for i in names}

print(result)
```

### Output

```text
{'Manoj': 5, 'Python': 6, 'Java': 4}
```

### Logic

```text
Name       → Key
Length     → Value
```

